<title>SINGAPORE: ST Computer in joint venture.</title>
<headline>ST Computer in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ST Computer Systems &amp; Services Ltd said on Thursday it had signed a memorandum of understanding (MOU) to set up a joint venture company to provide services through the Internet and electronic data interchange.</p>
<p>The MOU was signed with Sumitomo Corporation, Singapore Technologies Logistics and ST Telecommunications, said a company statement.</p>
<p>ST Computer and Singapore Technologies Logistics are subsidiaries of Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp .</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
